-- Insurance Act 1966 — THE ENCODER'S TESTS.
--
-- Every expected value is worked by hand from ../source/IA1966.txt; the
-- provision is on each group.

§ `Tests`

§§ `Helpers`

GIVEN life IS A BOOLEAN, general IS A BOOLEAN, reins IS A BOOLEAN, scheme IS A BOOLEAN, broker IS A BOOLEAN, exempt IS A BOOLEAN, individual IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Standing
`standing` life general reins scheme broker exempt individual MEANS Standing WITH
    `licensed for life business` IS life
    `licensed for general business` IS general
    `an authorised reinsurer` IS reins
    `a foreign insurer under a foreign insurer scheme` IS scheme
    `a registered insurance broker of the type` IS broker
    `an exempt insurance broker under s 92(1)(a)-(f), notified` IS exempt
    `exempted by the Authority from the provision` IS FALSE
    `an individual` IS individual

`nobody` MEANS `standing` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`a lone individual` MEANS `standing` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE
`a life insurer` MEANS `standing` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`a broker` MEANS `standing` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE

GIVEN c IS A `Class of business`, st IS A BOOLEAN, abroad IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN Activity
`insuring` c st abroad MEANS `carrying on a class of insurance business in Singapore as an insurer` c st abroad

GIVEN sh IS A NUMBER, vo IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Shareholding facts`
`holding` sh vo MEANS `Shareholding facts` OF sh, vo, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

§§ `Goals 1-3 — permission`

-- s 4(1): a general business licence does not cover life business
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `a life insurer` (`insuring` `life business` FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` (`standing` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`insuring` `life business` FALSE FALSE)
-- s 4(3): a life licence covers short-term accident and health business
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `a life insurer` (`insuring` `general business` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `a life insurer` (`insuring` `general business` FALSE FALSE)
-- s 3(6): a reinsurer acting wholly abroad does not carry on business here
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` (`insuring` `general business` FALSE TRUE)
-- s 55: a foreign insurer under a scheme
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` (`standing` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`insuring` `general business` FALSE FALSE)
-- s 4(2)(b): unsolicited reinsurance from abroad is permitted
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` (`providing reinsurance from outside Singapore to persons in Singapore` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` (`providing reinsurance from outside Singapore to persons in Singapore` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` (`standing` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`providing reinsurance from outside Singapore to persons in Singapore` FALSE)
-- s 6: the word "insurance" — an intermediary that says so; one that does not
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `a broker` (`using the word "insurance" in a business name` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `a broker` (`using the word "insurance" in a business name` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` (`using the word "insurance" in a business name` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
-- s 8(2): soliciting for a licensed insurer's overseas branch is not permitted
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` (`soliciting insurance business for an insurer` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` (`soliciting insurance business for an insurer` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` (`soliciting insurance business for an insurer` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- s 64: written agreement; an employee needs none
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `a lone individual` (`arranging a contract as agent for a licensed insurer` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `a lone individual` (`arranging a contract as agent for a licensed insurer` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- s 75, 92: broking needs registration or a s 92 exemption
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` `carrying on business as an insurance broker`
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` (`standing` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) `carrying on business as an insurance broker`
-- s 83: placing with an unlicensed insurer; reinsurance excepted; s 84 permission
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `a broker` (`a broker negotiating a contract with an insurer that is not licensed` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `a broker` (`a broker negotiating a contract with an insurer that is not licensed` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `a broker` (`a broker negotiating a contract with an insurer that is not licensed` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- s 86: volume-based; profit commission excepted
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `a broker` (`paying or receiving broker remuneration varied solely by volume` FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `a broker` (`paying or receiving broker remuneration varied solely by volume` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` (`using the words "insurance broking"` TRUE FALSE)

-- s 26(7): 20% of shares is effective control; 19.9% is not
#ASSERT `effective control of an insurer` (`holding` 20 0)
#ASSERT NOT `effective control of an insurer` (`holding` 19.9 19.9)
#ASSERT `effective control of an insurer` (`Shareholding facts` OF 5, 5, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `effective control of an insurer` (`Shareholding facts` OF 30, 30, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` (`obtaining control of a licensed insurer incorporated in Singapore` (`holding` 20 0) FALSE 0 FALSE)
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` (`obtaining control of a licensed insurer incorporated in Singapore` (`holding` 20 0) FALSE 0 TRUE)
-- s 27: below 20% but a substantial shareholder; a 5% voting arrangement; 4.9% is free
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` (`obtaining control of a licensed insurer incorporated in Singapore` (`holding` 6 6) TRUE 0 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` (`obtaining control of a licensed insurer incorporated in Singapore` (`holding` 1 1) FALSE 5 FALSE)
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` (`obtaining control of a licensed insurer incorporated in Singapore` (`holding` 1 1) FALSE 4.9 FALSE)
#ASSERT `the offence for` (`obtaining control of a licensed insurer incorporated in Singapore` (`holding` 20 0) FALSE 0 FALSE) EQUALS `s 26(6) obtaining effective control without approval, or breaching its conditions`
#ASSERT `the offence for` (`obtaining control of a licensed insurer incorporated in Singapore` (`holding` 6 6) TRUE 0 FALSE) EQUALS `s 27(7) becoming a substantial shareholder, or a 5% arrangement, without approval`
-- s 34(9): a major stake is more than 10%
#ASSERT `a major stake, shares` 10.1 `, votes` 0 `, directs:` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `a major stake, shares` 10 `, votes` 10 `, directs:` FALSE
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `a life insurer` (`a licensed insurer acquiring or holding a stake in a corporation` 40 40 FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `a life insurer` (`a licensed insurer acquiring or holding a stake in a corporation` 40 40 FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- s 87: 20% of a broker
#ASSERT `effective control of a broker, shares` 0 `, votes` 20
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `nobody` (`agreeing to acquire shares of a registered insurance broker` 25 0 FALSE)
-- s 35, 36: approval; a disqualified person only with consent
#ASSERT `the activity is permitted` `a life insurer` (`appointing a key executive person, chairperson or director` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is permitted` `a life insurer` (`appointing a key executive person, chairperson or director` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the offence for` (`appointing a key executive person, chairperson or director` FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS `s 35(16) lacking a required officer, or appointing without approval`
-- s 37: a director, $5,000; an employee, one year's emolument
