§§ `Goal 4 — penalties`

-- s 4(5): individual $125,000 / 3 years / $12,500 a day; otherwise $250,000 / $25,000 a day (split: no doubling)
#ASSERT `the maximum penalty for` `s 4(5) carrying on insurance business, or providing reinsurance, unlicensed` `, an individual:` TRUE `, a corporation:` FALSE EQUALS `IA penalty` OF 125000, 3, 12500
#ASSERT `the maximum penalty for` `s 4(5) carrying on insurance business, or providing reinsurance, unlicensed` `, an individual:` FALSE `, a corporation:` TRUE EQUALS `IA penalty` OF 250000, 0, 25000
-- s 75(2): one penalty for anyone; s 143 doubles it for a corporation
#ASSERT `the maximum penalty for` `s 75(2) carrying on broking unregistered` `, an individual:` TRUE `, a corporation:` FALSE EQUALS `IA penalty` OF 75000, 3, 7500
#ASSERT `the maximum penalty for` `s 75(2) carrying on broking unregistered` `, an individual:` FALSE `, a corporation:` TRUE EQUALS `IA penalty` OF 150000, 0, 15000
-- a firm, not a corporation: no doubling
#ASSERT `the maximum penalty for` `s 75(2) carrying on broking unregistered` `, an individual:` FALSE `, a corporation:` FALSE EQUALS `IA penalty` OF 75000, 0, 7500
-- s 17(6): a duty only on licensed insurers — no doubling
#ASSERT `the maximum penalty for` `s 17(6) failing fund solvency or capital adequacy` `, an individual:` FALSE `, a corporation:` TRUE EQUALS `IA penalty` OF 250000, 0, 25000
-- s 142(5): the officer of an insurer convicted under s 17(6): up to 2 years
#ASSERT `the maximum penalty for an officer of the convicted corporation, for` `s 17(6) failing fund solvency or capital adequacy` `, due diligence proved:` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`IA penalty` OF 250000, 2, 25000)
#ASSERT `the maximum penalty for an officer of the convicted corporation, for` `s 17(6) failing fund solvency or capital adequacy` `, due diligence proved:` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 6(7): individual $12,500 / 12 months / $1,250
#ASSERT `the maximum penalty for` `s 6(7) using the word "insurance" without entitlement` `, an individual:` TRUE `, a corporation:` FALSE EQUALS `IA penalty` OF 12500, 1, 1250
-- s 142(7): half the maximum fine
#ASSERT `the most that may be collected to compound` `s 4(5) carrying on insurance business, or providing reinsurance, unlicensed` `, an individual:` TRUE `, prescribed:` TRUE EQUALS JUST 62500
#ASSERT `the most that may be collected to compound` `s 4(5) carrying on insurance business, or providing reinsurance, unlicensed` `, an individual:` FALSE `, prescribed:` TRUE EQUALS JUST 125000
#ASSERT `the most that may be collected to compound` `s 75(2) carrying on broking unregistered` `, an individual:` FALSE `, prescribed:` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 101(6) prescribes no penalty: s 142(3) applies
#ASSERT `the maximum penalty for` `s 101(6) receiving a report knowing it was disclosed in breach (s 142(3))` `, an individual:` TRUE `, a corporation:` FALSE EQUALS `IA penalty` OF 50000, 2, 5000
-- s 145
#ASSERT `the Act reaches an act` `outside Singapore, with a substantial and reasonably foreseeable effect in Singapore` `, an offence under s 4, 8, 70 or 75:` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the Act reaches an act` `outside Singapore, with a substantial and reasonably foreseeable effect in Singapore` `, an offence under s 4, 8, 70 or 75:` FALSE
#ASSERT `the Act reaches an act` `partly in and partly outside Singapore` `, an offence under s 4, 8, 70 or 75:` FALSE
#ASSERT `an offence under s 4, 8, 70 or 75` `carrying on business as an insurance broker`
#ASSERT NOT `an offence under s 4, 8, 70 or 75` `holding out as a registered insurance broker`

