§§ `Goals 6-7 — the policy`

GIVEN s IS A `Residence status`, out IS A NUMBER, now IS A BOOLEAN, days IS A NUMBER, cont IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Residence facts`
`residence` s out now days cont MEANS `Residence facts` OF s, out, now, days, cont

-- para 2(4)(a): a citizen abroad 5 years and not now resident is not; 4 years is
#ASSERT NOT `ordinarily resident in Singapore` (`residence` `a citizen` 5 FALSE 0 0)
#ASSERT `ordinarily resident in Singapore` (`residence` `a citizen` 4 FALSE 0 0)
#ASSERT `ordinarily resident in Singapore` (`residence` `a citizen` 6 TRUE 0 0)
#ASSERT `ordinarily resident in Singapore` (`residence` `a permanent resident` 0 TRUE 183 0)
#ASSERT NOT `ordinarily resident in Singapore` (`residence` `a work pass or permit holder` 0 TRUE 182 0)
#ASSERT `ordinarily resident in Singapore` (`residence` `a holder of another pass longer than 90 days` 0 TRUE 0 90)
#ASSERT `a Singapore treaty, Singapore premiums` 26 `, of` 100
#ASSERT NOT `a Singapore treaty, Singapore premiums` 25 `, of` 100

GIVEN k IS A `Kind of policy`, life IS A `Life insured`, interest IS A NUMBER, sum IS A NUMBER, years IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Policy case`
`policy` k life interest sum years MEANS `Policy case` WITH
    `kind` IS k
    `issued on` IS YMD 2020 1 1
    `issued in the course of business in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `the owner (or insured) is an individual` IS TRUE
    `residence of the owner or insured` IS `residence` `a citizen` 0 TRUE 365 365
    `a non-individual: Singapore address, residence or permanent establishment` IS FALSE
    `the risk arises in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `cargo carried between places outside Singapore` IS FALSE
    `insurance on ships or goods, or a contract of indemnity` IS FALSE
    `may be in force more than 5 years, insurer cannot end it but for fraud or non-disclosure` IS FALSE
    `life insured` IS life
    `insurable interest of the person effecting it` IS interest
    `a trust policy meeting s 146(3) or (4)` IS FALSE
    `sum insured` IS sum
    `age of the person entering the contract` IS 30
    `written consent of a parent or guardian` IS FALSE
    `years in force` IS years
    `an annuity, or no policy moneys necessarily payable` IS FALSE

`own life` MEANS `policy` `a life policy` `the person's own life` 0 500000 4
#ASSERT `the policy is` `own life` EQUALS "a Singapore policy"
#ASSERT `the class of business of` `own life` EQUALS `life business`
#ASSERT `the policy is valid for insurable interest` `own life`
#ASSERT `the most that may be recovered under` `own life` EQUALS JUST 500000
-- s 146: a stranger's life, no insurable interest — void; with $200,000 of interest, capped
#ASSERT NOT `the policy is valid for insurable interest` (`policy` `a life policy` `another person` 0 500000 4)
#ASSERT `the most that may be recovered under` (`policy` `a life policy` `another person` 200000 500000 4) EQUALS JUST 200000
-- s 149: three years in force
#ASSERT count (`the owner's statutory rights under` `own life`) EQUALS 4
#ASSERT count (`the owner's statutory rights under` (`policy` `a life policy` `the person's own life` 0 500000 2.9)) EQUALS 1
-- First Sch para 9: a short-term accident and health policy is general business
#ASSERT `the class of business of` (`policy` `an accident and health policy` `the person's own life` 0 1000 1) EQUALS `general business`
-- s 151: general insurance without interest is void, unless indemnity
#ASSERT NOT `the policy is valid for insurable interest` (`policy` `a general insurance policy` `another person` 0 1000 1)
-- s 147: 11 with consent, yes; 15 without, no; 16 alone, yes; 10, no
#ASSERT `has capacity to insure, aged` 11 `, with a parent's written consent:` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `has capacity to insure, aged` 15 `, with a parent's written consent:` FALSE
#ASSERT `has capacity to insure, aged` 16 `, with a parent's written consent:` FALSE
-- fork F8 as revised: 10 or under, the section does not answer
#ASSERT REFUSED `has capacity to insure, aged` 10 `, with a parent's written consent:` TRUE
-- s 66
#ASSERT `the insured still owes the insurer, owed` 1000 `, paid to the intermediary` 1000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the insurer still owes the insured, owed` 5000 `, paid to the intermediary` 5000 EQUALS 5000

GIVEN k IS A `Nomination kind`
      ns IS A LIST OF `Nominee`
      age IS A NUMBER
      trust IS A BOOLEAN
      revoked IS A BOOLEAN
      dealt IS A BOOLEAN
      will IS A BOOLEAN
      notice IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Estate facts`
`estate` k ns age trust revoked dealt will notice MEANS `Estate facts` OF k, ns, age, trust, revoked, dealt, will, notice

`wife and son` MEANS LIST (`Nominee` OF "wife", TRUE, 0.5, TRUE), (`Nominee` OF "son", TRUE, 0.5, TRUE)
`a friend` MEANS LIST (`Nominee` OF "friend", FALSE, 1, TRUE)

