#ASSERT `the death benefits go` (`estate` `a trust nomination under s 132` `wife and son` 40 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS "to the trustees, in trust for the nominees; outside the owner's estate and debts (s 132(4))"
