§§ `The top-level goals`

GIVEN s IS A Standing, a IS AN Activity, p IS A `Place of the act`
GIVETH A `Regulatory case`
`case` s a p MEANS `Regulatory case` OF s, a, p, TRUE

-- an unregistered broking company in Singapore: s 75(2), $75,000 doubled by s 143 to $150,000; compound up to $37,500
`unregistered broker` MEANS `the regulatory position for` (`case` `nobody` `carrying on business as an insurance broker` `wholly in Singapore`)
#ASSERT NOT `unregistered broker`'s `permitted`
#ASSERT `unregistered broker`'s `the offence if not permitted` EQUALS JUST `s 75(2) carrying on broking unregistered`
#ASSERT `unregistered broker`'s `maximum penalty` EQUALS JUST (`IA penalty` OF 150000, 0, 15000)
#ASSERT `unregistered broker`'s `most that may be collected to compound` EQUALS JUST 37500
-- an individual soliciting from abroad, with effect in Singapore, for an unlicensed insurer: s 145(2) reaches s 8
`offshore solicitor` MEANS `the regulatory position for` (`case` `a lone individual` (`soliciting insurance business for an insurer` FALSE FALSE FALSE) `outside Singapore, with a substantial and reasonably foreseeable effect in Singapore`)
#ASSERT `offshore solicitor`'s `the Act reaches the act`
#ASSERT `offshore solicitor`'s `maximum penalty` EQUALS JUST (`IA penalty` OF 125000, 3, 12500)
-- holding out as a broker from abroad: s 145(2) does not reach s 90
`offshore holding out` MEANS `the regulatory position for` (`case` `nobody` `holding out as a registered insurance broker` `outside Singapore, with a substantial and reasonably foreseeable effect in Singapore`)
#ASSERT NOT `offshore holding out`'s `the Act reaches the act`
#ASSERT `offshore holding out`'s `maximum penalty` EQUALS NOTHING
-- a licensed life insurer writing life business: permitted
#ASSERT (`the regulatory position for` (`case` `a life insurer` (`insuring` `life business` FALSE FALSE) `wholly in Singapore`))'s `permitted`

`a policy and nomination` MEANS `the policy position for` `own life` `, estate` (`estate` `a revocable nomination under s 133` `a friend` 40 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `a policy and nomination`'s `Singapore or offshore` EQUALS "a Singapore policy"
#ASSERT `a policy and nomination`'s `valid for insurable interest`
